**/*.md
!CHANGELOG.md
# WHY exception for docs/routines + .claude: cloud agents (scheduled
# remote triggers) clone the repo fresh and need binding rules to
# continue autonomous work across sessions. Local WIP .md files
# elsewhere in the repo remain gitignored.
# TEMPORARY: CLAUDE.md and docs/superpowers/** re-added to gitignore
# this session per user request to keep `git status` short and avoid
# bloating prompt context. Restore the `!CLAUDE.md` and
# `!docs/superpowers/**/*.md` exceptions when the user lifts the hold.
!docs/routines/**/*.md
!.claude/**/*.md
# WHY: issue templates (.yml) and any future workflow docs live under
# .github/; the blanket **/*.md rule would otherwise exclude markdown
# files added there (e.g. pull_request_template.md).
!.github/**
# WHY: fuzz/README.md is a contributor-facing quick-start doc for the
# cargo-fuzz harness; it needs to be tracked so new contributors can
# find invocation + triage instructions without reading source files.
!fuzz/README.md
target/
.DS_Store
*.swp
node_modules/
apps/desktop/dist/
apps/desktop/dist-types/
.codex
